### 1. Consumer 调用 Core Ping (透传租户 100 与 Bearer Token)
GET http://localhost:7141/core/ping?message=hello_from_smoke_test
Accept: application/json
x-tenant-id: 100
x-caller-zone: zone-east-1a
Authorization: Bearer aspros-jwt-bearer-token-1001

### 2. 模拟超时调用 (验证 Deadline 级联熔断)
GET http://localhost:7141/core/ping?message=test_timeout
Accept: application/json
x-tenant-id: 200
x-simulate-delay: 800
Authorization: Bearer aspros-jwt-bearer-token-2001
